**Prefix definitions:**
- `rowPrefix[i][j]` = sum of row `i` up to column `j-1`.
- `colPrefix[i][j]` = sum of column `j` up to row `i-1`.
- `diagPrefix[i+1][j+1] = grid[i][j] + diagPrefix[i][j]` → main diagonal sum from `(r,c)` to `(r+k-1,c+k-1)` is `diagPrefix[r+k][c+k] - diagPrefix[r][c]`.
