1. We have products array and searchWord
2. After each character typed, we need to return up to 3 products with common prefix, lexicographically smallest ones.

Approach 1: Sort products, then for each prefix of searchWord, use binary search (lower_bound) to find the first product >= prefix, then take up to 3 products that start with the prefix.

