- Example 1: indegrees are [0,1,1,1], root=0, BFS visits all 4 → true ✓
- Example 2: node 3 has indegree 2 (child of both 1 and 2) → false ✓
- Example 3: both nodes have indegree 1, no root exists → false ✓

